{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33340","headline":"策试夜潜纪长句於都堂西南隅 一 · 韦承贻","name":"策试夜潜纪长句於都堂西南隅 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"褒衣博带满尘埃，独自都堂纳卷回。\n蓬巷几时闻吉语，棘篱何日免重来。\n三条烛尽钟初动，九转丹成鼎未开。\n残月渐低人扰扰，不知谁是谪仙才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦承贻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}